2. Forbidden Actions

By reading or cloning this repository, you agree NOT to:

1. Copy, reproduce, or redistribute the Code in whole or in part.

2. Submit the Code to any competition, hackathon, project, or assignment.

3. Share screenshots, snippets, or logic with anyone without explicit written permission.

