Violators may be subject to:

1. Instant disqualification from any current and future competitions.

2. DMCA takedown notices on any copied content.

3. Civil lawsuits seeking $10,000 per line copied, plus attorney fees.

4. Public shaming on social media, Discord, and all relevant coding communities.

5. The Author reserving the right to summon the coding gods (metaphorically) to curse offenders.

Note: Even looking at this code too long may be considered “guilty by association.”

